1
00:00:00,996 --> 00:00:03,296
(Sheldon:)Uh, first, music is dangerous.

2
00:00:03,298 --> 00:00:06,538
The movie Footloose tried to
warn us, but we wouldn't listen.

3
00:00:06,535 --> 00:00:10,005
(Sheldon:)Oh, wait.
♪ Everybody cut footloo... ♪

4
00:00:10,005 --> 00:00:11,505
(Sheldon(singing):)Nope.

5
00:00:11,506 --> 00:00:15,846
I'll pay $1,000 to watch you
cut footloose.

6
00:00:16,712 --> 00:00:18,882
(Sheldon:)This is Penny.

7
00:00:19,715 --> 00:00:22,485
(Sheldon:)She is your friend.

8
00:00:22,484 --> 00:00:24,954
(Sheldon:)If she offers you food,
it's safe to take it.

9
00:00:24,953 --> 00:00:27,753
(Sheldon:)You probably
paid for it, anyway.

10
00:00:29,925 --> 00:00:31,955
(Bernadette:)So, you're really going out
with Dave again?

11
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,190
(Amy:)Why not?

12
00:00:33,195 --> 00:00:34,525
(Amy:)He's actually a very nice guy.

13
00:00:34,529 --> 00:00:36,399
(Bernadette:)But he spent an entire date

14
00:00:36,398 --> 00:00:38,728
(Bernadette:)talking about how much
he loves Sheldon.

15
00:00:38,734 --> 00:00:40,864
(Amy:)That's nothing Sheldon
hasn't done before.

16
00:00:42,838 --> 00:00:44,608
(Amy:)Dave's just a big
fan of his work.

17
00:00:44,606 --> 00:00:47,376
(Amy:)Besides, he said he
wouldn't bring it up again.

18
00:00:47,375 --> 00:00:49,605
(Bernadette:)Okay. So where's he taking you?

19
00:00:49,611 --> 00:00:52,681
(Amy:)Oh, he's coming here.
I'm actually making dinner.

20
00:00:52,681 --> 00:00:54,751
(Bernadette:)Oh. That's a big step.

21
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:56,080
(Amy:)It is?

22
00:00:56,084 --> 00:00:58,514
(Bernadette:)Yeah. You're inviting him
into your home.

23
00:00:58,520 --> 00:00:59,820
(Bernadette:)It's intimate.

24
00:00:59,821 --> 00:01:02,761
(Bernadette:)It's where your underpants live.

